*.csv
*.json
*.geojson
*.tif
*.tiff

# Exception: Keep configuration and documentation JSON/CSV files
!requirements.txt
!**/README.md
!**/IMPROVEMENT_PLAN.md
!docs/**/*.json
!INPUT/**/*.json
